[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アイラさん、ルトガーさん。先にユミアさんたちに\n会いに行かなくてよかったんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla, Rutger... Are you sure you don't want to see Yumia and the others first?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいんだよ。こっちはまだ、なんの成果も挙げてねぇ。\n泣き付きに行ったみてぇになるだろうが？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nah, we've got nothing to show for our efforts yet. I don't wanna go crawling back empty-handed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは。コイツ素直じゃないから。\n自慢できるような情報を持って帰りたいんだよね～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha. He's just being stubborn. He wants to bring back something worth bragging about."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "意地ってやつだな。分かるぜ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pride, eh? I get that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "けっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アイラはヴィクトルの妹なのよね？\n心配してたわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla, you're Viktor's sister, right? He's been worried about you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へへっ。兄妹だけど調査団員だもん。\n近々会えるんだから、それでい～かな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. We may be siblings, but we're both survey team members. I'll see him soon enough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ルトガーも一応団員なんだけどね、見ての通り\n素直じゃないし、一人で行動しがちでね～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger's technically part of the team too, but as you can see, he's stubborn and tends to run off on his own."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "調査団の話はユミアから聞いたわ。\n錬金術は禁忌の術だってこともね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia told me about the research team. And how alchemy is considered taboo."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ～。でもユミアのこと、今はみんな、ちゃんと\n仲間だと思ってるんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, yeah. But everyone sees Yumia as a true comrade now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うんうん。私たちの世界では、錬金術は昔の時代に\n廃れた技だったのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mm-hmm. In our world, alchemy was a lost art from ancient times."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それを復興させたくて、私たちは力を合わせて\n「果ての大陸」を目指して旅をしてるの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're working together to revive it, journeying toward World's End."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へぇ……「果ての大陸」かぁ。\nヴァレリアには夢があるんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... World's End, huh? You've got big dreams."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "夢っていうか……私ね、記憶が無いのよね。\n色々あって、ちょっと前に無くしちゃったの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dreams... well... I actually lost my memories. It happened not too long ago."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え。それ、不安じゃないの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What? Doesn't that worry you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "正直言うとね。前の私のことを思い出せないから、\nみんなの期待に応えられないかもしれないし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To be honest... since I can't remember who I used to be, I'm worried I might not live up to everyone's expectations..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで余計に頑張っちゃうって感じ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So that just makes you try even harder?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んなこと悩んだって、しょうがねぇだろうが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No point worrying about stuff like that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだ？\u3000お前さんも記憶を無くしたのかよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's this? You lost your memories too?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうなの！？\u3000ルトガーも私と同じ記憶喪失なのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really!? You're an amnesiac like me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前は不可抗力で無くしたんだろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You lost yours against your will."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "不可抗力……どうかしらね。\nその時のことは覚えてないから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Against my will... I wonder. I can't remember how it happened."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "つかよ。その口ぶりじゃあ、\nお前は不可抗力じゃないってことか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold on. The way you're talking... yours wasn't against your will?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだオレに不満あんのか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You got a problem with that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、あんたらとはここまでだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fine then. This is where we part ways."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと、やめなよルトガー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, stop it, Rutger!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "事情があったんでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You had your reasons, didn't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ？\u3000なんでそう思った？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? What makes you think that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ルトガーがそういう奴に見えない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You don't seem like the type who'd do it without good reason."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……けっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...tch."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "オレは、売ったんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I sold them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "マナについてはユミアたちから聞いてんだろ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've heard about mana from Yumia and the others, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "オレたちの世界じゃ、記憶は金になる。そいつを\nマナにすれば金持ちどもに売れるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In our world, memories are worth money. Turn them into mana and the rich will buy them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "貧乏だったからな。オレは生きていくために\n記憶を金にしたんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was poor. Had to sell my memories just to survive."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おぉ……お前も壮絶な人生送ってんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "... you've had it rough too, huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん。つまり大事なもののために\n記憶を引き換えにしたってことで合ってるかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. So you traded your memories for something important. Did I get that right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私もね、大事な何かを守るために、記憶を\n引き換えにしたみたいなの。一緒ね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You know, I think I traded my memories to protect something important too. We're the same!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はぁ！？\u3000なに言ってんだよてめえ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-what!? What are you talking about!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぷっ……ふふふ。ヴァレリアって最高……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pff... hehehe. Valeria, you're the best..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、笑ってんじゃねぇよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "D-don't laugh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたが動揺してるの見るのって、いいよねぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's just so fun seeing you get flustered."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あぁ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]